# Deployment

Read `docs/deployment.md` before changing scripts, the Vite base, GitHub Pages, or Coolify files. Update that doc in the same change.

- Production `base` is `./` so `dist/` works on project pages. The exporter does not fetch logos. The PRIME and webinar logos load from `media.primeinc.org`.
- GitHub Pages deploys the mock app. The Synapse-backed app is meant for Coolify, where browsers can reach internal endpoints.
- Do not commit secrets. Document env var names in `docs/deployment.md`. `.env.example` lists those names with empty values. Put values in `.env.local` only.
- Coolify uses the repo `Dockerfile` and `nginx.conf`. When that hosting shape changes, record service type, port, build, and how Synapse is reached in `docs/deployment.md`.
